  "title": "Storming of the Bastille",
  "summary": "On 14 July 1789 a crowd in Paris, seeking gunpowder and arms, attacked the Bastille fortress after royal troops had massed near the city and minister Necker had been dismissed. Fighting broke out and the garrison surrendered. Seven prisoners were found inside. Governor de Launay was killed by the crowd on the way to the Hôtel de Ville.",
